block_probZSigmoid output: probability substrate routes to .block. Threshold 0.5 ‚Üí predicted block.
*
†ÄR∂
length_normöZ-normalized linear output. Denorm: predicted_chars = length_norm * length_std + length_mean. length_mean / length_std are saved in user_defined_metadata.
*
†ÄRy
latency_norm]Z-normalized linear output. Denorm: predicted_ms = latency_norm * latency_std + latency_mean.
*
†ÄRÜ
verbosity_probhSigmoid output: P(AFM body > 1500 chars). UI hint: long-response anticipation. Threshold 0.5 ‚Üí 'long'.
